<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc1">Hos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hos</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chibu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Hosea atendagwa mlongi ywa Chohile mwe isi yakwe, kugamba mo ulongozi wa chenya wa Izulaeli mo mhilimo wa 750-725 Kulisito henati Kwelekwa. Kalongoilwa ni muwoni Amosi uyo iviya atambalisaga mo ulongozi wa chenya wa Izulaeli. Hosea akwahila vitendese mbuli za miviko ya milungu yo udanti mwe ichipindi chakwe na kuswesa uzumizi kwa Chohile mwa Waizulaeli. Mbuli iyo ya kumhituka Chohile Hosea aitambaliuisa kwa chilagiso cha wikazi wakwe wa nyinka. Enga viya mkaziwe Gomeli amhituke na kuleka kutenda mkanuni, seivyo nivyo wantu wamhituke Chohile. Kwachausa icho, wantu wa Izulaeli nawakantilwe. Mna hamwenga neivyo mo udumo Chohile, kwa ungi wakwe mkulu nawavuze na kuvuza umbuya wakwe nawo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 1-3 yatambalisa wikazi wa vnyinka ya Hosea na mkaziwe ni chilahgiso cha kuhitukila kwa Waizulaeli kwa Chohile.</para>
  <para style="io">Hosea atambalisa nkanto ya Chohile kwa wantu wose, mna iviya alagisa kugamba mo udumo ungi wa Chohile nauhude.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 4-14 yalonga utambalisi mtuhu wa muwobni.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1" />Uno nu ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile umwizile Hosea mwana ywa Beli chipindi cho ulongozi wa seuta Uziya na Yotamu na Ahazi na Hezekiya maseuta wa Yuda, na Yeloboamu mwana ywa Yoashi seuta ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="HOS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkaza Hosea na wanawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2" />Umo Zumbe Chohile akongaga kulonga na Waizulaeli kujinkila Hosea, Zumbe kamgamba, “Hita ukasole mvyele mchilanga weleke naye wana wo chilanga, kwaviya wantu muno mwe isi wadamanya uchilanga utendese kwa kunileka miye na kuvikila milungu.” <verse eid="HOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3" />Elo, Hosea niyo amsola mvyele akwitangwa Gomeli mchiche ywa Dibulaimu. Gomeli niyo enula nda na kumweleka Hosea mwana ywa chilume. <verse eid="HOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4" />Chohile niyo amgamba Hosea, “Mwana uyo mwitange Yezileli, kwaviya chisigala chipindi chidodo naniwakantile wantu we ikaya ya Yehu kwa ukomi wadamanye kwe dikolongo dya Yezileli. Naniubuze udumo useuta wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="HOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5" />Mwe dizuwa idyo nanizibalange izinguvu zo ugomba nkondo za Izulaeli uko kwe Dibwandasi dya Yezileli.” <verse eid="HOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6" />Gomeli niyo enula nda ntuhu efungula mwana chiche. Zumbe amgamba Hosea, “Mwana uyo mwitange Lo Ruhama, nuko kugamba saniwaunge vituhu wantu wa Izulaeli, naho saniwalekeile. <verse eid="HOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7" />Mna naniwawone mbazi wantu wa Yuda na kuwakombola. Miye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, naniwakombole, mna suko kwa udahi wa wagomba nkondo hegu uta hegu mabamba hegu falasi na wakwela falasi. Mna ni kwa sila ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo.” <verse eid="HOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8" />Gomeli eze amlekeze ukonka Lo Ruhama, niyo enula nda vituhu, kamwelekela Hosea mwana mtuhu ywa chilume. <verse eid="HOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Hosea, “Mwana uyo mwitange Lo Ami, kugamba nyuwe hamwi wantu wangu, na miye suyo Chohile ywenyu.”<verse eid="HOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izulaeli naivuzagizwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 1:10" />Hata ivyo, Wantu wa Izulaeli nawatende walozesa saviya msanga wa mpani hewikuhimika hegu kuwazika. Hadya awagambaga, “Nyuwe hamwi wantu wangu”, Haluse nawagambe, “Nyuwe mwi wana wa Chohile mta ujima!” <verse eid="HOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 1:11" />Wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Izulaeli nawalungane vituhu na kusagula chilongozi ywawo yumwenga, awo nawauye kulawa ko usamizo na kwikala mwe si yawo wenye. Kwaviya zuwa idyo dya Yezileli naditende dikulisa.<verse eid="HOS 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1" />Elo, “Walukolo wako wetange, Wantu wa Chohile”, iviya walumbu zenyu wetangeni, “Wakungigwa ni Zumbe.”<verse eid="HOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvyele mchilanga na wantu wavu wa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2" />Wanangu, mkwahileni mami yenyu mkwahileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:2">kwaviya uyo suyo mkazangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:2">miye nami suyo mgosiwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:2">Mkwahileni alekane no uchilalanga wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:2">enegane no ujenda uyaga wakwe.<verse eid="HOS 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3" />Hegu sivyo, nanimvule izisuche asigale mwazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">nanimtende saviya endaga umo akelekwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">Nanimtende ekele savia jangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">nanimwike anyale saviya si ikalukise.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">Nanimkome kwa nchilu.<verse eid="HOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4" />Wanawe saniwawone mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:4">kwaviya ni wana wo chilanga.<verse eid="HOS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5" />Mami yawo kadamanya uchilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">kenula izinda zawo kwa kudamanya mbuli za soni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">Alongaga, “Nantongelezane ne ivyendegwa vyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">awo wakuninka nkande na mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">suche zidamanywe kwa mazoya ya ngoto na kitambala ching'aile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">mavuta na divai.”<verse eid="HOS 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6" />Elo, miye Chohile, namzibila isila yakwe kwa gwegwe dya miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:6">nanimzungulusize chiwambaza asekupata sila ya kufoseza kuse.<verse eid="HOS 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7" />Gomeli nawabase ivyendegwa vyakwe mna hawapate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:7">nawalonde mna hawawone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:7">Akajika nagambe, “Nanuye kwa mgosi ywangu ywe nkongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:7">kwaviya aho nkongo nendile nna lwedilwedi ukaleka vino nili haluse.”<verse eid="HOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8" />Gomeli hamanyize kugamba ni miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:8">nimwinkile uhule na divai mya na mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:8">simjenyezeza mayuwe ya chumba na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:8">izo ajeseze kumvikila Baali.<verse eid="HOS 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9" />Ivyo chipindi cho uvuni naniguhe uhule wangu, nanuse idivai yangu ichipindi chakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:9">Nanimhoke izisuche zangu zidamanywe kwa mazoya ya ngoto na ze chitamabala ching'aile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:9">izo zikujeseza kugubika umwazi wakwe.<verse eid="HOS 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10" />Nanimvule ekele mwazi kulongozi kwa wadya wakumunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:10">naho hahana mntu nadahe kumwambula kulawa mo udahi wangu.<verse eid="HOS 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11" />Nanchinde umbwedo wakwe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:11">ngasu zakwe za mnenge ukatontomoka na mazuwa yo Kuhumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:11">ne zingasu zose zilagizwe.<verse eid="HOS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12" />Naniibalange mizabibu yakwe ne miti ye imitini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:12">iyo agambile ni maliho enkigwe ni vilaga vyakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:12">Mizabibu ne mizaituni yakwe naniihituse mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:12">iyo naidigwe ni wanyama wa kumbago.<verse eid="HOS 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13" />Nanimkantile kwachausa cha amazuwa yadya avunkize ubani kwa Mabaali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:13">umo ehambile kwa mpete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:13">na mayuwe ya yombe kulu, na kuwabasa vilaga wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:13">mna miye kanijala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:13">Akulonga ni Miye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="HOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ungi wa Zumbe Chohile mwa awantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14" />Ivyo nanimluvye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:14">na kumlongoza kubula kwe dijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:14">nilonge naye mpalahole.<verse eid="HOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15" />Uko nanimvuzize izinkonde zakwe ze mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:15">bwandasi dya Akoli nanditende nchili ya msuhi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:15">Nanitongele kwa kunga mwenye saviya endaga mndele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:15">enga mazuwa yadya alawaga kwe isi ya Misili.<verse eid="HOS 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16" />Miye Zumbe Chohile nagambe, “Mwe dizuwa idyo nonitange ‘Mgosi ywangu’, honitange vituhu ‘Baali ywangu’”.<verse eid="HOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17" />Kwaviya mazina ya Mabaali naniyause kulawa mwe milomo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:17">halombeze vituhu kwa mazina yawo.<verse eid="HOS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18" />Nandamanye lagano na wanyama wa kumbago na wadege wo ulanga hamwenga na vyose vikutambala mwe sanga visekukulumiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:18">Uta na sime na viziha vya nkondo nanivyuse mwe isi, na kukutenda wikale mpeho.<verse eid="HOS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19" />Nahulombe utende mkazangu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:19">utende ywangu kwa ukanuni na uwagila, kwa ungi na mbazi.<verse eid="HOS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20" />Nahulombe kwa ukanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:20">weye nonimanye miye ni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="HOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21" />Mwe idizuwa idyo miye Zumbe Chohile nanihitule mo ulanga na ulanga nauhitule kwe isi,<verse eid="HOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22" />isi naihitule kwa kulavya uhule na divai na mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:22">ivyo navichintize viya vikungwa mwa Yezileli.<verse eid="HOS 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23" />Nanimhande Yezileli mwesi kwachausa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:23">miye nanilagise ungi wangu kwa, “Hekuwonelwa mbazi”,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:23">na wadya nagambile “Sawo wantu wangu.” Naniwagambe, “Nyuwe mwi wantu wangu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:23">Awo nawagambe, “Weye wi Chohile ywetu.”<verse eid="HOS 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Hosea na mvyele mchilanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Hosea, “Hita vituhu ukamunge yudya mkaziwo, hata hegu aungwa ni mgosi mtuhu naho ni mchilanga. Umunge saviya Zumbe Chohile akuwaunga wantu wa Izulaeli, hata hegu wahitukila wavikila milungu na kungisa mikate imwile ya zabibu inyaile isentigwe.” <verse eid="HOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2" />Elo, simlihila uyo mvyele hela zikwitangwa shekeli mlongo umwenga na shano na chilo gana dimwenga na milongo mishano za shaili kumgula mvyele uyo. <verse eid="HOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3" />Vikaheza niyo namgamba, “Nawikale na miye mazuwa yalozize, hukungigwa ukatenda mchilanga hegu uhajihi wa kungana na mntu yoyose, miye nami nanikale na weye du.” <verse eid="HOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4" />Kwaviya wantu wa Izulaeli nawekale mazuwa yalozize hewena seuta hegu chilongozi, hewena ntambiko hegu mnala, hegu kasuche kakugubika mwe chifuwa hegu matukulu na kusinya mnamumulo. <verse eid="HOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5" />Nyumani, Waizulaeli nawauye na kumlonda Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, na Daudi seuta ywawo. Aho nawamvikile Zumbe Chohile kuno wazingiza na kugoja wedi wakwe mazuwa yo udumo.<verse eid="HOS 3:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile asopana na Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1" />Nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli tegelezani ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile ana laho mwenyu nyuwe mkwikala muno mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:1">“Muno mwe isi hamna ukanuni hegu wedi, mwe ino isi hamna akummanya Chohile.<verse eid="HOS 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2" />Muno mwe isi mlaila kwelisa udanti na ukomi na ubavi na uchilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:2">Kukomana kwalaila chila nkanana.<verse eid="HOS 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3" />Elo, isi yose inyala, wekazi wakwe wose wabanika hamwenga na awanyama wa kumbago na wadege,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:3">hata izisamaki mwe bahali nazife.”<verse eid="HOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile alemana na walavya ntambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4" />Mna mntu yoyose asekuleta laho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:4">mntu yoyose asekumfuzumila mnyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:4">kwaviya wantu wako ni sawadya wakuhigana na mlavyantamiko.<verse eid="HOS 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5" />Weye wekobadika chilo na msi, wawoni wekobadika hamwenga na weye nechilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:5">Elo, nanimkome mami yako Izulaeli.<verse eid="HOS 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6" />Wantu wangu wafa kwaviya hawanimanyize miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:6">weye mlavyantambiko kulemela mahinyo yangu, kwaviya kulemela mahinyo yangu nami sikulemela weye utenda mlavyantambiko ywangu. Kwaviya kuleka kutimila sigilizi ya Chohile ywako, miye nami wanawo naniwaleke wasekutenda walavyantambiko.<verse eid="HOS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7" />Iviya walavyantambiko wakujenyela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:7">nivyo wose wakujendeleza kukola masa kulongozi kwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:7">Elo ntunyo yawo naniihitule itende soni.<verse eid="HOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8" />Walavyantambiko watenda wagoli kwa malavyo ya wantu wangu wata masa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:8">Mwaungisa kuwawona wadamanya mbuli za masa.<verse eid="HOS 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9" />Mna ayo nayawagwele wantu wangu nayo nayawapate walavyantambiko, naniwakantile kwachausa cho ulujendo lwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:9">naho naniwalihize mwe izintendwa zawo nawadamanye.<verse eid="HOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10" />Nawadye, mna hawegute, nawagonyane mna hawapate wana, kwaviya wanasa miye Zumbe Chohile na kutongela milungu.<verse eid="HOS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zumbe Chohile aligita miviko ye milungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11" />Zumbe Chohile agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:11">“Mo uchilanga wawo divai mpya na ya kale zose zausa umanyi mwa wantu wangu!<verse eid="HOS 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12" />Wantu wangu walombeza ulangilizi kulawa tukulu dya mti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:12">kaziti ka mlamulo nako kakuwenka cho kulonga. Nkwina yo uchilanga iwazaganya, hawana ukanuni kwa Chohile ywawo.<verse eid="HOS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13" />Walavyantambiko kulanga kwe vinenengwa vya amagulu, na malavyo ya kutikimya mlanga mwe wagulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:13">hasi he miti ya mialoni na mifune na mikwazu kwaviya mpeho zawo zitima vyedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:13">Ulailo wakwe wachiche wenyu wajenda uyaga na wavyele msoile wagonywa ni wagosi watuhu.”<verse eid="HOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14" />Mna wachiche wenyu wakajenda uyaga na wavyele msoile wakagoywa ni wagosi watuhu saniwakantile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:14">kwaviya wagosi wenye nawo wakujesanya na wachilanga na kuvika hamwenga nawo mwe mviko wo uchilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:14">Wantu hewena akili nawakomwe.<verse eid="HOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15" />“Chindedi nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli mwiwachilanga! Mna msekuwatenda wantu wa Yuda watende na mlema!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:15">Msekwita hantu hakukile uko Giligali hegu Beti aveni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:15">Naho msekwelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile mta ujima wa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="HOS 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16" />Wantu wa Izulaeli ni wankani enga mpunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:16">Elo, kwambwani Chohile etumbwadise kuwadima enga ngoto kwe luwala lwa suko?<verse eid="HOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17" />Wantu wa Efulaimu welunga mwe matukulu. Waleke du wajendeleze.<verse eid="HOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18" />Hata wakaleukwa nukozi wawo, wajendeleza no uchilanga wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:18">vilongozi wawo wongisa mbuli za soni.<verse eid="HOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19" />Elo, nawafiliswe ni luzimu, naho ntambiko zawo naziwajele soni kwe milungu yawo yo udanti.”<verse eid="HOS 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1" />Tegelezani nyuwe walavyantambiko! Hata nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli! Tegelezani nyuwe lukolo lwa chiseute! Nyuwe namkaungwa mdamanye uwagila, hantu hakwe mtenda mtego uko Misipa, lwavu luhindigwe uko Taboli. <verse eid="HOS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2" />Wantu wanihituka miye na kukoma wantu walozese, elo naniwakantile wose. <verse eid="HOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3" />Wantu wa Izulaeli siwamanya ivyo mwili, nyuwe hamkudaha kunefisizawefisa. Nyuwe wantu hamwiwakanuni, wantu wose hawakuwagila kunivikila.<verse eid="HOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hosea awafunda wakuvikila milungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4" />Ntendwa zawo zawachinda wasekumuwiya Chohile ywawo. Wamemeza uchilanga mwe myoyo yawo. Miye Zumbe Chohile hawanimanyize. <verse eid="HOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5" />Kweduvya kwa Waizulaeli kwelagisa pwilili, wantu wa Efulaimu wekobadika mwe mlema wawo, wantu wa Yuda wekobadika hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="HOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6" />Waita na mafyo ya ngoto na ng'ombe, vileke wakamlonde Zumbe Chohile, mna hawamuwone, kwaviya kesunga nawo. <verse eid="HOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7" />Wabalanga ukanuni kwa Zumbe Chohile, weleka wana wo uchilanga. Elo, ngasu zawo zo umnenge ukatontomoka naziwakome, hamwenga ne izinkonde zawo.<verse eid="HOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondo mwa Yuda na Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8" />Towani mahugu uko Gibeya, na magunda uko Lama! Tulani nguto za nkondo uko Betihaveni! Nyuwe wantu wa Benjamini, mnkondo nywenyu ehanyuma. <verse eid="HOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9" />Zuwa nanilavye nkanto, Efulaimu naitende jangwa. Icho hutambalisa mwa makabila ya Izulaeli, chindedi ni mbuli nailale. <verse eid="HOS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10" />Vilongozi wa Yuda watenda na chihituhitu cha kuhituila mihaka ye sanga. Elo naniwakantile hatenda simukwa ni maya enga nkulujumbu ya mazi. <verse eid="HOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11" />Wantu wa Efulaimu wasulumizwa, kahokwa uwagila wakwe, kwaviya kekamba kutimila matukulu. <verse eid="HOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12" />Nanidamanye ubanasi mwa wantu wa Yuda na kuhosa nkomano mwa wantu wa Yuda. <verse eid="HOS 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13" />Wantu wa Efulaimu weze wabunkule unyonje wawo, na wantu wa Yuda weze wawone izinkwenje zawo, wantu wa Efulaimu niyo waita Ashulu kulombeza wambizi kwa seuta mkulu, mna uyo kadunduga kuwalagula na kuwahonya izinkwenje zawo.<verse eid="HOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14" />Wantu wa wantu wa Efulaimu na wantu wa Yuda naniwebunge saviya simba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:14">Miye mwenye naniwatatavule vihande hande na kuhalawa, naniwegale hale</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:14">naho hahana nawambule.<verse eid="HOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15" />“Vikaheza nanuye hantu hangu na kwesunga nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:15">kubula wazumile ubanasi wawo na kuniwiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:15">Nkunto zawo naziwahinye wanilonde.”<verse eid="HOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Kweila kwa udanti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1" />Wantu wagamba, “Chiteni chikamuwiye Zumbe Chohile! Yeye mwenye kachihiwa, mna yeye mwenye nachihonye. Yeye mwenye kachilumiza, mna yeye mwenye nachilaguze izinkwenje zetu. <verse eid="HOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2" />Mazuwa maidi yanajinka, nachinke ujima vituhu, nachuyuse zuwa dya katatu, vileke chidahe kwikala kulongozi kwakwe. <verse eid="HOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3" />Elo, chimzumile chihikilize kummanya Zumbe Chohile. Kwiza kwakwe nukanuni saviya zuwa dikutontomoka, nachizile saviya mawaga, enga fula za masika zikunywesa isanga.” <verse eid="HOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4" />Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, “Niwatendele mbwani nyuwe wantu wa Efulaimu? Wantu wa Yuda niwatendele chintu chani? Ungi wenyu kwangu nisaviya kungugu dya mtondo, enga mnyuzu ukusunguza kupugutika. <verse eid="HOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5" />Nivyo vilekile hawasigila wawoni wangu kwenyu wakatenda na ulosi wa nkanto na ubanasi. Icho hunga kwenyu ni uchindedi. <verse eid="HOS 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6" />Icho hunga kwenyu ni ungi, sikunga ntambiko. Wantu wammanye Chohile ukaleka kulavya malavyo ya kutikimya.”<verse eid="HOS 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubanasi wenela mwe isi yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7" />“Mna saviya Adamu watula lagano nilagane nawo, hawatendile wakanuni kwangu. <verse eid="HOS 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8" />Gileyadi ni mzi umemile wantu wehiye na wakomi. <verse eid="HOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9" />Walaavyantambiko wesaviya wapolaganyi wakugoja mntu mwe sila, wechisanya na kunyatila. Wakoma wantu mwesila kuhinga Shekemu, wadamanya wavu utendese. <verse eid="HOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10" />Siwona mbuli ikwihiza vitendese mwa wantu wa Izulaeli, wantu wangu wejela uzavu wenye kwa kuvikila matukulu. <verse eid="HOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11" />Iviya, nyuwe wantu wa Yuda, sika chipindi cha kuwakantilani kwachausa che zimbuli mkudamanya. Umo nanivuze vituhu kuchumilwa kwa wantu wangu.”<verse eid="HOS 6:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1" />Chila nkanana haunga niwahonye wantu wangu wa Izulaile, masa ya Efulaimu yagubulwa na wavu wa Samaliya wabunkulwa. Wadamanya udanti, wabavi watula mwe zinyumba na kubawa, wapolaganyi webunga wantu mwe zisila. <verse eid="HOS 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2" />Hawakufanyanya kugamba miye simanya mbuli zawo zose zihiye wakudamanya. Masa yawo yawazunguluka ntendele zose ye kulongozi kwangu.<verse eid="HOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njama ihiye mwe idizumba dye chiseuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Wantu wambwedeza seuta mo wavu wawo, wawabwedeza masekulu mo ubanasi wawo. <verse eid="HOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4" />Wose ni wachilanga, wenga tanuli dijimbigwe moto, uyo ajimbile umoto hakuukonkanya kukongela akande unga kubula umuka. <verse eid="HOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5" />Mwe ngasu dya ngasu ya seuta, vilongozi wanywelesa mpombe, seuta mwenye awahongeza watilizi. <verse eid="HOS 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6" />Myoyo yawo yaka kwa wihi saviya tanuli dikwaka, maya yawo yavunka mosi chilo chijima, ikabula mtondo yalibu saviya myale ya moto. <verse eid="HOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7" />Wose wemukwa ni tama saviya tanuli dikwaka, wakoma vilongozi wawo. Maseuta wawo wose wagwa, hahana akunilombeza wambizi.”<verse eid="HOS 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Izulaeli waika msuhi mwe izisi ntuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Wantu wa Efulaimu wehanganya na wantu we izisi ntuhu. Awoneka esaviya mkate hewiviye vyedi. <verse eid="HOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9" />Wajeni wamfyosa izinguvu zakwe, mna yeye mwenye ivyo havimanyize. Fili zakwe zina fi hano na hadya, mna hakukombaganya. <verse eid="HOS 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10" />Kweduvya kwa Wantu wa Izulaeli wefenyesa, mna hamwenga na ivyo vyose, hawakuya kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywawo, hegu kumlonda. <verse eid="HOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11" />Izulaeli esaviya kasuwa manga kahezi hekena akili, zee kaita kakulombeza Misili, zee kahitukila kalombeza Ashulu. <verse eid="HOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12" />Umo nawaite nanihinde lwavu lwangu niwagwize, naniwagwise hasi enga wadege wo ulanga, naniwakantile kuligana no ubanasi wawo. <verse eid="HOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13" />Nawaluwone kwaviya wanileka miye! File iwagwela kwaviya wanihituka. Nahaunga niwambule mna waniziga lulimi. <verse eid="HOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14" />Hawakunilombeza viya vikuwagila, mna wagalagala na kwesengasenga mwe zisazi zawo, vileke niyeve amalombezo yawo yo uhule ne divai, mna wahitukila hale na miye. <verse eid="HOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15" />Miye siwahinya na kuwajela nguvu, mna wanekambila wihi. <verse eid="HOS 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16" />Waihitukila milungu yo udanti, wesaviya uta utohoke. Vilongozi wawo nawakomwe kwa mabamba, kwachausa che milosi yawo yo kweduvya. Elo, nawabelwe kwe isi ya Misili.”<verse eid="HOS 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile awakantila wantu wa Izulaeli kwaviya wavikila matukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Towani magunda! Mnkondo eza enga gushu kuyebunga Inyumba ya Chohile kwaviya wabalanga lagano dyangu na kuhituila sigilizi yangu. <verse eid="HOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2" />Waizulaeli wanitanga Chohile ywawo na kugamba wanimanya, <verse eid="HOS 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3" />mna Waizulaeli mbuli zedi wazilemela, elo, wankondo nawamwebate. <verse eid="HOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4" />Wesagwila maseuta, hehena ulangilizi wangu, waika masekulu mna miye nendile siwamanyize. Wedamanyiza milungu ya chumbu na zahabu, mbuli iyo naiwakome wenye. <verse eid="HOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5" />Nyuwe wantu wa Samaliya maya yangu yawemukilani nyuwe, tukulu dyenyu dye ndama nadihiwa vitendese. Namjendeleze kutenda na mlema kubula ini? <verse eid="HOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6" />Kwaviya mwe isi ya Izulaeli mlaila mbuli saivyo! Tukulu dyenyu idyo didamanywa ni fundi. Idyo suyo Chohile hata kujeza, elo tukulu idyo dye ndama naditulwe vihande hande. <verse eid="HOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7" />Wahanda mpeho nawavune luzimu! Mbeyu wahandile kwezinkonde hazilavye maiso, hata yanalavya maiso nayadigwe ni wajeni. <verse eid="HOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 8:8" />Waizulaeli wamelwa, vino haluse wekala mgati mwe wantu we izisi ntuhu enga chiya hechikuwagila mwe ndima yoyose. <verse eid="HOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 8:9" />Kwaviya waita wakulombeza wambizi Ashulu. Wantu wa Efulaimu wesaviya mpunda luwala ikwangadika ichedu, wantu wa Efulaimu waliha hela vileke wapate wambizi kulawa kwe wantu we izisi ntuhu. <verse eid="HOS 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 8:10" />Hata hegu wetaga wenye mwa wantu we izisi ntuhu, mna miye naniwachisanye hamwenga. Nawakonge kusulumizwa na kuzilwa ni seuta mta nguvu.” <verse eid="HOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 8:11" />“Wantu wa Izulaeli wezengela mazabahu yalozize ya kulaviza ntambiko za kusa masa, mna mazabu izo zitenda hantu hakudamanyiza masa. <verse eid="HOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 8:12" />Hata hegu siwawandikila sigilizi zangu nkanana zilozize, wowo waziwona ni chintu cha chijeni mwawo. <verse eid="HOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 8:13" />Wongisa kulavya ntambiko na kudya izinyama izo ze ntambiko, mna miye Zumbe Chohile sikubweda hata kujeza. Miye nafanyanya wavu wawo, naniwakantile kwachausa cha masa yawo, naniwavuze Misili ko tumwa. <verse eid="HOS 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 8:14" />Waizulaeli wamjala Mumbi ywawo, wezengela mazumba ya kweduvila, wantu wa Yuda weongezeza mizi ya ngome, Mna nanigale moto kwe mizi iyo na kuzitikimya izingome zawo.”<verse eid="HOS 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli nawakantilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1" />Nyuwe Waizulaeli msekudamanya ngasu saviya wakudamanya wantu we izisi izintuhu, kwaviya hamwiwakanuni kwa Zumbe Chohile ywenyu. Mungisa maliho ya uchilanga chila hantu ha kuhwagila ngano. <verse eid="HOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2" />Mna ingano na mapipa ye divai haviwachinteni, divai mpya naiwahungukileni. <verse eid="HOS 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3" />Wantu wa Izulaeli hawasigale mwe isi ya Zumbe Chohile, nawauye kwe isi ya Misili ko utumwa, nawadye nkande zijeligwe uzavu uko Ashulu. <verse eid="HOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4" />Hawamlavize divai Zumbe Chohile, hegu kumwelela kwe izintambiko zawo. Nkande yawo naitende enga nkande ya matanga, wose nawaidye nawajelwe uzavu. Nkande iyo naitende ni ya kuwegusa du, isekwigalwa kwe Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="HOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5" />Namdamanye chibwani mwe dizuwa dye ngasu ilagizwe, hegu mwe ngasu ya kumtunya Zumbe Chohile? <verse eid="HOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6" />Vyadahika Waizulaeli wasiku wadaha wachulupuke nkomano mwe isi yawo umo wakebungwa ni Wasiliya, mna Wamisili nawawakome na kuwahamba uko komzi wa Memfisi. Hazina zewo ze chumbu nazimemwe ni mani, mahema yawo nayamemwe ni miwa. <verse eid="HOS 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7" />Mazuwa ye nkanto yasogela, mazuwa ya kulihiza chikoda yabula, Waizulaeli waungwa wachimanye chipindi icho. Kwaviya masa yatendesa na unkondo wenyu ukulisa, muwoni atendwa ni mhezi, mntu akulongozwa ni Chohile awonwa ni mchilalu. <verse eid="HOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8" />Chohile kasagula muwoni wakwe chani awafunde wantu wakwe wa Izulaeli. Mna chila hantu akwita enikilwa mitego enga kadege. Hata mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywakwe awonwa maya. <verse eid="HOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9" />Wantu wa Izulaeli wadamanya mbuli zihise saviya wadamanyaga wantu wa Gibeya. Chohile nakumbuke wavu wawo na kuwakantila kwachausa cha masa yawo wakudamanya.<verse eid="HOS 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masa ya Waizulaeli na ulailo wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Umo nawabwilaga Waizulaeli vyendaga saviya kubwila zabibu kwe jangwa. Nize niwawone wakale wenyu wendaga, vyendaga saviya kuwona ntunda za nkongo mwe mti ukwitangwa mtini. Mna weze wabule uko Baali peoli, wesenta vileke wavikile ihizo Baali, niyo watenda ihizo saviya icho wongile. <verse eid="HOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11" />Ntogozi ya wantu wa Efulaimu nausike enga kadege, hakutende na cheleko naho hakutende na mvyele neleke mwana hegu kwinula nda. <verse eid="HOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12" />Elo, hata waneleka wana na kuwalela, miye naniwakome hasigale mjima hata yumwenga. Nawaluwone umo nnahalawa na kuwasa ichedu.” <verse eid="HOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13" />Saviya niwone aho nkongo, wantu wa Efulaimu wendaga enga mtende ukusuka he nkonde ntana, mna vino haluse aungwa awegale wanawe kwa mnkondo wakakomwe. <verse eid="HOS 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14" />Nilombeze chintu chani uwatendele wano wantu? Watende wavyele wawo wasekweleka, waswese mele ya kuwonkeza wana wawo. <verse eid="HOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Wavu wawo wose ukongela Giligali, uko nuko nikongile kuweihiwa. Kwachausa cha wavu we izintendwa zawo, naniwabalaze mwe Inyumba yangu. Saniwaunge vituhu, vilongozi wawo wose wanihituka. <verse eid="HOS 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16" />Wantu wa Efulaimu wesaviya mti unyaile amaizi hewikweleka, hata waneleka wana wawo wakuwaungisa nawakoma.” <verse eid="HOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17" />Kwaviya walemela kumwetegeleza, Chohile ywangu nawadule, awo nawangadike mwe izisi ntuhu.<verse eid="HOS 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1" />Wantu wa Izulaeli wendaga saviya mzabibu mtana, mzabibu ukweleka matunda. Viya wajendeleze kuchumilwa nivyo wahikilize kwezengela mazabahu. Iviya isanga yawo ikulavya ulozo utendese nivyo wahikilize kuhamba izinguzo zawo wakuvikila. <verse eid="HOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2" />Myoyo yawo imema udanti, elo haluse nawengile mwe mlema wawo. Zumbe Chohile nabogozole izimazabahu zawo na kubalanga izinguzo zawo. <verse eid="HOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3" />Chipindi icho wantu nawagambe, “Hachina seuta vituhu kwaviya hachikumvikila Zumbe Chohile, mna hata hegu chatendile na seuta nakadaha kuchidamanyiza chibwani?” <verse eid="HOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4" />Icho wakulonga ni milosi ya bule, welisa udanti umo wakadamanya wivano, elo, ulahi wahota enga mani ya sumu mwe nkonde ilimigwe. <verse eid="HOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5" />Wekazi wo umzi wa Samalia nawazingize kwachausa che indama ya uko Beti aveni. Wantu wakwikala uko nawalomboleze kwachausa che ndama iyo, hata walavyantambiko wakuivikila nawailombolezeze, kwaviya ntunyo yakwe yuswa. <verse eid="HOS 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6" />Tukulu idyo nadigalwe Ashulu uge maliho kwa seuta mkulu. Wantu wa Efulaimu nawajelwe soni, Waizulaeli nawadiwone soni iditukulu dyawo. <verse eid="HOS 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7" />Seuta ywa Samaliya naguhigwe enga chihande cha mti mlanga mwe mazi. <verse eid="HOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8" />Hantu ho kuvikila matukulu kwa wagulu wa Aveni nahabalangwe, aho ni hantu Waizulaeli wakoile masa. Izimazabahu zawo nazihote miwa na mishongoma. Awo nawayagambe magulu “Chigubikeni!”, Na wagulu “Chifunteni!” <verse eid="HOS 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9" />Nyuwe Waizulaeli, nyuwe mkola masa kukongela kudya Gibeya, naho mchei mwajendeleza. Chindedi namkomwe ni nkondo uko Gibeya. <verse eid="HOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10" />Wano wantu wavu naniwezile na kuwakantila, wantu we izisi ntuhu nawechisanye na kuwebunga kwachausa cha masa yenyu yalozese. <verse eid="HOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11" />Efulaimu ni saviya ndama ihinyigwe vyedi, kaungisa kududula maiso. Mna haluse naninyinye ziti dikwitangwa nila mwe singo yakwe ntana. Awantu wa Yuda wenye nawalime kwa jembe dikukweswa ni ng'ombe, heye, Yakobo nakwese jembe dya kukandula ulongo. <verse eid="HOS 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12" />Handani vyedi kwa loso lwenyu, nanywi namvune ungi, limani nkonde zasigwe, kwaviya chipindi cho kunilonda miye Zumbe chibula, miye naniwajimbikeni. <verse eid="HOS 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13" />Mna nyuwe mhanda wavu, niyo mwavuna ubunyanyi mdya matunda yalawane no udanti wenyu. Kwaviya weye Izulaeli nakwika msuhi mwe izinguvu zako mwenye, na ulozo wa wagomba nkondo wako. <verse eid="HOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14" />Elo, msindo wa nkondo nowezile wantu wako, izingome zako zose nazibalangwe, saviya Shalimani abalange umzi wa Beti Alibeli mwe zuwa diya dye nkondo, wavyele niyo wakomwa hamwenga na wana wawo. <verse eid="HOS 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15" />Nivyo navitende mwenyu nyuwe wantu wa Beteli kwachausa cho wavu wenyu ukulise. Mwe idizuwa idyo kunacha, seuta ywa Izulaeli nakomwe.<verse eid="HOS 10:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Ungi wa Chohile mwa Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Umo Waizulaeli wendaga wana nawaungaga, kulawa Misili namwitangaga mwanangu. <verse eid="HOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2" />Mna iviya huhikiliza kuwetanga nivyo wakwitisa hale na miye, waita wakuvikila Baali na kuyavunkiziza ubani matukulu ya milungu. <verse eid="HOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3" />Ni miye niwahinyize kujenda wantu wa Efulaimu, siwatoza mikono hawademeza, mna hawabunkule kugamba ni miye niwahonyize. <verse eid="HOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4" />Siwalongoza kwa ungi wa chimntu, heye kwa mbazi, siwausiza nkunto na kufunama niwalise. <verse eid="HOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5" />Elo, nawauye vituhu wakatende watumwa kwe isi ya Misili, nawalongozwe ni seuta ywa Ashulu kwaviya walemela kuleka masa yawo. <verse eid="HOS 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6" />Wankondo nawengile mwe imizi ya Waizulaeli na kubalanga izifulemu mwe izinchili zawo na kuchinda myalo yawo. <verse eid="HOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7" />Wantu wangu wekamba wanase, wanigamba miye ni Chohile mta nguvu, mna hawakunitunya hata hadodo. <verse eid="HOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8" />Nyuwe wantu wa Efulaimu, nadaha niwaseni vivihi? Nyuwe Waizulaeli nadaha zeze kuwadulani? Nanidahe vivihi kukutendela saviya niutendele umzi wa Adima? Nanidahe vivihi kukutendela saviya niutendele umzi wa Seboimu? Umoyo wangu wanichinda, mbazi zangu mwenyu zitendesa. <verse eid="HOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9" />Maya yangu yatendese naniyachinde, wantu wa Efulaimu saniwakome vituhu, kwaviya miye ni Chohile suyo mntu. Ni miye Mkuka mgati mwenyu, miye sanize kwenyu kwa maya. <verse eid="HOS 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10" />Nawanilonde miye Zumbe Chohile hubuma enga simba mwa wankondo wawo, umo habuma nawanibase kulawa uswelo wa zuwa kuno wazingiza. <verse eid="HOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11" />Kulawa Misili, naweze wakazingiza saviya wadege, nawapuluke kulawa Ashulu saviya wasuwamanga, miye Zumbe Chohile silonga naniwavuze kwawo.”<verse eid="HOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izulaeli na Yuda wakantilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 11:12" />Wantu wa Efulaimu wanizungulusiza mbuli zo udanti, na Waizulaeli waniziga lulimi. Wantu wa Yuda wanihituka miye Chohile Mkuka ichedu.<verse eid="HOS 11:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1" />Chila chintu wakudamanya wantu wa Izulaeli kukongela msi kubula chisingi ni saviya wabalaza nkung'unto yo ulailo wa zuwa, wahikiliza udanti na kweduvya. Wadamanya wivano na wantu wa Ashulu na kwigala mavuta ya zaituni kwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="HOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2" />Zumbe Chohile ana laho mwa wantu wa Yuda, nawakantile awelekwa wa Yakobo kuligana ne zintendwa zawo. <verse eid="HOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3" />Umo Yakobo endaga mwe nda ya nine amtozaga mkuluwe ichisigino, eze akule niyo ahigana na Chohile. <verse eid="HOS 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4" />Ahiganaga na mndima ywa kwembingu niyo amhuda, vikaheza niyo aila na kulombeza ajimbikwe. Chohile niyo adugana na kulonga na Yakobo uko Beteli. <verse eid="HOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5" />Zumbe Chohile ywa wagomba nkondo, Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose nidyo idizina dyakwe. <verse eid="HOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6" />Haluse nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli muwiyeni Chohile ywenyu. Mtende wakanuni na uwagila, msuhi wenyu mwike kwakwe. <verse eid="HOS 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Wantu wa Izulaeli wesaviya wachuluzi wakuhimila vihimo vyo udanti, waungisa kubunyanya wantu.” <verse eid="HOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8" />Wantu wa Izulaeli weduvya wagamba, “Suwe chiwagoli, ugoli wetu ulozesa! Mo ugoli wangu wose hawabwile chintu nibunyanye, chihikiliza kuuchisanya hehena kukola masa.” <verse eid="HOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9" />“Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu niwalavizeni kwe isi ya Misili! Miye naniwatende mwikale vituhu mwa mahema saviya mwa mazuwa yenyu ye izingasu zilagizwe. <verse eid="HOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10" />Miye nalongaga na wawoni, ni miye niwenkile uwoni ulozizs na kwa sila yawo silonga kwa miliganyo. <verse eid="HOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11" />Giligali ni hantu ha masa, wantu wakwe hawakuwagila chintu wavikila njeku, elo, izimazabahu zawo nazihituswe sugulu za mayuwe mwe nkonde ilimigwe.” <verse eid="HOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12" />Yakobo asumkilaga kwe isi ya Alamu, umo akatendeka eyuko adamanyaga ndima apate mvyele, kadima ngoto vileke apate mvyele. <verse eid="HOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13" />Zumbe Chohile atumaga muwoni kuwalavya Waizulaeli kweisi ya Misili na kuwatunduliya. <verse eid="HOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14" />Mna wantu wa Efulaimu wamwihiza Zumbe Chohile vitendese. Mna Zumbe Chohile nawalihize ubanasi wawo, nawakantile kwa mbuli zawo zo wavu wadamanye.<verse eid="HOS 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Nkanto yo udumo mwa wantu wa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1" />Mwe chikale vilongozi we dikabila dya Efulaimu wakalonga, wantu nawakazingiza, wantu nawakawatunya vilongozi wawo, mna wantu niyo wengila mlema kwa kumvikila Baali, mbuli iyo iwahosa wabanike. <verse eid="HOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2" />Vino haluse wachei wajendeleza kudamanya masa, wedamanyiza matukulu ya chumbu yadamanywe kwa untanda wawo, yose yasanwa ni mafundi. Wagamba, “Haya yavikileni, wayasesa na kuyalaviza ntambiko amatukulu ayo yombigwe saviya ndama!” <verse eid="HOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3" />Elo, wantu wano nawosika saviya kungugu dya mtondo, saviya mnyuzu ukusunguza kuhugutuka. Saviya lumpwimpwi lukufilika hantu ha kuhetela, enga moshi ukulawa mwe langa. <verse eid="HOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4" />Mna Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Miye ni Zumbe Chohile ywenyu niwalavizeni kwe isi ya Misili, mwungwa mkombaganye kugamba hahana mnungu Chohile mtuhu ukaleka miye, naho hahana Mwambula ukaleka miye. <verse eid="HOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5" />Ni miye niwatunduliyeni umo mwendaga kwedijangwa si yendaga na unyazi utendese. <verse eid="HOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6" />Mwize mbule kwe si ntana niyo mwatenda na nkande ilozize mwize mdye na kwiguta, niyo mwakonga kweduvya na kunijala miye. <verse eid="HOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7" />Elo, nanitende enga simba mwenyu, naniwanyatileni enga suwi. <verse eid="HOS 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8" />Saviya kala dikwitangwa dubu dihokigwe wanawe, naniwebungeni na kutatula ivifuwa vyenyu. Naniwatatavule saviya simba, na kala dya kumbago nadiwahanye vihande hande.” <verse eid="HOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9" />“Nyuwe Waizulaeli, naniwakomeni! Ni yuhi nadahe kuwambizani? <verse eid="HOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10" />Seuta ywenyu ekuhi vileke awambuleni? Masekulu wenyu mwe mizi yose wekuhi awo mwagambaga niwenkeni? <verse eid="HOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11" />Namemaga maya, mna niyo nazumila kuwenkani seuta, kwa maya yangu yatendese niyo namusa.” <verse eid="HOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12" />“Ubanasi wa Waizulaeli uwandikwa, masa yakwe yaikwa kwe hazina. <verse eid="HOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13" />Usungu saviya wa mvyele akwefungula mwana wamwizila, mna yeye ni mwana hene ubala, chipindi cho kwelekwa chikabula alemela kulawa mwe nda ya nine. <verse eid="HOS 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14" />Wantu wano naniwambule kulawa kwe dibome hedine uhelo, naniwakombole kulawa mwe file! We file, ukomi wako wikuhi! We bome hedine uhelo, ubanasi wako wikuhi? Saniwawoneleni mbazi vituhu.” <verse eid="HOS 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15" />“Hata hegu wantu wa Efulaimu nawachumilwe mgati mwa wantu wakwe, miye nanivumize nkung'unto ulailo wa zuwa ikulawa kwedijangwa mazi mwa masima yakwe nayasile sokwe zakwe nazinyale. Hazina zakwe zose za yombe kulu nazitahwe. <verse eid="HOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 13:16" />Wantu wa Samaliya nawakantilwe mo ubanasi wawo. Nawakomwe kwa mabamba kwaviya wamhituka Chohile ywawo, watiti wawo nawahondwehondwe, wavyele wawo wasoka nawatumbulwe.”<verse eid="HOS 13:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Kweila kwaleta ujimbiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1" />Nyuwe Waizulaeli muwiyeni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu. Mwekobadika kwachausa cha masa yenyu. <verse eid="HOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2" />Muwiyeni Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywenyu, milosi ino itende nuko kweila kwenyu, “Chohile chakweila chilekeile masa yetu yose, chiwonele mbazi chiza kwako, nachikutogole kwa milomo yetu enga malavyo yetu kwako. <verse eid="HOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3" />Ashulu haikuda kuchambula, hachikwika msuhi vituhu mwe falasi za nkondo. Matukulu chisanile wenye hachiyetange Chohile ywetu vituhu. Kwaviya kwako wabanikilwe ni watati zawo wafilwa mbazi.”<verse eid="HOS 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujima mhya mwa Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4" />Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Nanihonye unkani wawo, naniwaunge vituhu kwa kunga kwangu mwenye, kwaviya saniwaihiwe vituhu. <verse eid="HOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5" />Nanitende uge mnyuzu mwa Waizulaeli, awo nawabwalike saviya luwa dikwitangwa yungiyungi nawatende na maizi saviya mti wa mwelezi wa Lebanoni. <verse eid="HOS 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6" />Matambi yawo nayasuke na kutima, ugoli wakwe nautende enga miti ya mizaituni, nawapwepweleke saviya mielezi ya Lebanoni. <verse eid="HOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7" />Wantu nawauye na kwikala wakadimwa ni miye, nawahande mbeyu naziwenke ulozo utendese. Nawachumilwe enga mzabibu ikweleka vikocha vilozize. Nawamanyikise enga divai ikulawa Lebanoni. <verse eid="HOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8" />Nyuwe wantu wa Efulaimu, matukulu ya mbwani naho? Malombezo yenyu naniyahitule na kuwatunduliyani. Miye ni saviya mti wa mboleshi, kuchumilwa kwako kwalawa kwangu.” <verse eid="HOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9" />Mntu yoyose mta ubala mbuli zino nazimanye na mntu mta umanyi nazikombaganye. Kwaviya sila za Zumbe Chohile zichuma, zatimilwa ni wantu wachumile, mna wantu wavu zawakobadisa.<verse eid="HOS 14:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14" />
</usx>